    <title>Drupal and the rise of the Documents</title>
    <link>https://barcelona2012.drupaldays.org/sessions/drupal-and-rise-documents</link>
    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;field field-type-userreference field-field-speakers&quot;&gt;
