&lt;p&gt;In this session I will show you tools how you can find out how your Drupal behaves. Which parts of your PHP script are taking the most load and slow your system. Just install the devel module and xhprof and connect them. At the end of the session you should be able to run performance analysis on your own.&lt;/p&gt;
